This article loads its bibliography from an external file via `<library src=…>`
rather than pasting the entries inline. The citation<cite @Loomes2017> resolves
against the loaded reference, and the formatted list renders below — the
`<library src>` block itself renders nothing.

<bibliography></bibliography>

<data>
<library src="references.bib" />
</data>
